## FaceVault Models

The face recognition model `face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx` is required to run FaceVault but is not included in this repository because of its file size.

Download the official SFace model from the [OpenCV Zoo SFace repository](https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface).

Place the downloaded ONNX file in this `models` folder using the filename expected by the application.
